    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d39">

                <pb facs="0114" n="24" sameAs="frus:frus1918Russiav02/pg24"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 861.00/924</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in China</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Reinsch</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1918-01-10T20:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">January 10,
                                1918, 8 p.m.</hi></date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your January 9, 5 p.m. Have instructed Moser to send Drysdale.
                    Speskov may accompany if you and Moser
                    consider necessary. If so advise Department approximate expense necessary before
                    taking decision.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Lansing</hi></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
